    "Original WavePDE solve and plain characteristic tracing; no A* paths or graph-search fallback. Only successful, collision-checked routes are displayed; failed attempts remain in the retained run.",
    "Each source uses a 4096 x 4096 m local crop with 8 x 8 x 4 m voxels. This is not a full-domain global-optimality or all-9900-pairs result.",
    "PDE first-peak arrival time is retained separately. Playback time integrates the recorded path using the solver airspeed ellipsoid and frozen wind; it is not a measured flight time.",
    "Frozen 3-D model wind at 7500 s is transferred by local height above terrain from the original flat geometry; it was not recomputed or validated by CFD on the restored terrain.",
    "100 synthetic ground stations with 12 m takeoff and landing gates. Flight ceiling 30 m AGL; no real landing-site survey or vehicle-dynamics validation.",
